OL,3,AUK long-term borrowing costs highest
OL,4,Asince 1998 ahead of October Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong-term government borrowing costs
OL,7,Fhave risen to a 28-year high, putting
OL,8,Ffurther pressure on Prime Minister Andy
OL,9,FBurnham ahead of his first Budget next
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FThe yield on a 30-year gilt ` a loan to
OL,13,Fthe British government ` rose to 5.89%,
OL,14,Fthe highest since 1998.
OL,16,FThe effective cost of borrowing for
OL,17,Fgovernments across the globe has
OL,18,Fcontinued to rise this morning with new
OL,19,Fmulti-decade highs in market interest
OL,20,Frates.
