OL,3,AUK long-term borrowing costs highest
OL,4,Asince 1998 ahead of October Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe moves reflect concerns about
OL,7,Finflation arising from the ongoing Iran
OL,8,Fwar, competition from major tech firms
OL,9,Ffor long-term borrowing, and concerns
OL,10,Fabout state borrowing levels.
